{"seq":1,"slug":"military-satellites","title":"军事卫星系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites","wordCount":1297,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"军事卫星系统\">军事卫星系统</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>军事卫星是现代战争的「天眼」和「神经中枢」，为作战行动提供侦察监视、通信中继、导航定位和导弹预警等关键支撑。没有太空资产，现代精确制导武器、全球指挥通信和战场态势感知都将失去基础。太空已成为大国军事竞争的战略制高点。</p>\n<p>理解军事航天的钥匙，是看清四类卫星如何分工协作，把太空变成支撑地面一切作战的「信息底座」——侦察看得见、通信连得上、导航打得准、预警来得及。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    REC[&quot;侦察卫星&lt;br/&gt;(看得见)&quot;] --&gt; C2[&quot;地面指挥&lt;br/&gt;态势感知&quot;]&#10;    COM[&quot;通信卫星&lt;br/&gt;(连得上)&quot;] --&gt; C2&#10;    NAV[&quot;导航卫星&lt;br/&gt;(打得准)&quot;] --&gt; WPN[&quot;精确制导武器&quot;]&#10;    EW[&quot;预警卫星&lt;br/&gt;(来得及)&quot;] --&gt; BMD[&quot;导弹防御&quot;]\">graph TD\n    REC[\"侦察卫星&lt;br/&gt;(看得见)\"] --&gt; C2[\"地面指挥&lt;br/&gt;态势感知\"]\n    COM[\"通信卫星&lt;br/&gt;(连得上)\"] --&gt; C2\n    NAV[\"导航卫星&lt;br/&gt;(打得准)\"] --&gt; WPN[\"精确制导武器\"]\n    EW[\"预警卫星&lt;br/&gt;(来得及)\"] --&gt; BMD[\"导弹防御\"]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"四类军事卫星对比\">四类军事卫星对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>典型轨道高度</th>\n<th>代表系统</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>侦察卫星</td>\n<td>250–600 km（LEO/SSO）</td>\n<td>KH-11「锁眼」</td>\n<td>光学分辨率约 0.1 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信卫星</td>\n<td>35,786 km（GEO）/ LEO</td>\n<td>AEHF、Starlink</td>\n<td>抗干扰/低延迟中继</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导航卫星</td>\n<td>≈20,200 km（MEO）</td>\n<td>GPS、北斗三号</td>\n<td>M码定位优于 1 m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预警卫星</td>\n<td>GEO/HEO + LEO</td>\n<td>SBIRS、Next-Gen OPIR</td>\n<td>助推段红外探测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"侦察卫星-太空的眼睛\">侦察卫星：太空的眼睛</h3><p>光学侦察卫星受衍射极限约束，角分辨率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.22</mn><mfrac><mi>λ</mi><mi>D</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 1.22 \\frac{\\lambda}{D}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.22</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 为角分辨率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为波长（可见光约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5\\,\\mu m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 为镜头口径。KH-11「锁眼」采用约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 口径（与哈勃相当），在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>300</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">300\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">300</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span> 高度的分辨率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.076</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.076\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.076</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。合成孔径雷达（SAR）卫星不受天气和昼夜限制，方位向分辨率等于实际天线长度的一半。电子侦察卫星（如「猎户座」系列）部署在 GEO，配备直径超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的展开式天线，能截获微弱的手机信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"通信卫星-抗干扰与低延迟\">通信卫星：抗干扰与低延迟</h3><p>美国 AEHF 工作于 EHF 频段（44GHz 上行/20GHz 下行），总通信容量约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8.2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>Gbps</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8.2\\,\\text{Gbps}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Gbps</span></span></span></span></span></span>，采用跳频扩频和自适应零点天线，即使在核 EMP 环境下也能保证总统对核力量的指挥通信。低轨通信星座是当前热点：SDA「传输层」部署数百颗低轨卫星，提供约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>ms</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\,\\text{ms}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ms</span></span></span></span></span></span> 低延迟中继。乌克兰军队大量使用 Starlink，证明了商业低轨星座的军事价值（其频谱对抗见 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/electronic-warfare\">电子战技术</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"导航卫星与导航战\">导航卫星与导航战</h3><p>GPS 星座由 24 颗以上卫星组成（轨道高度约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>km</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20200\\,\\text{km}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">km</span></span></span></span></span></span>，倾角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">55°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55°</span></span></span></span></span>），军用 PPS 使用加密 P(Y) 码和 M 码，精度优于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。中国北斗三号于 2020 年完成全球组网（24 MEO+3 GEO+3 IGSO），其短报文通信功能使其兼具导航与通信能力。导航战（NavWar）是围绕卫星导航的攻防：进攻方干扰或欺骗使敌方接收机失效，防御方用 7 阵元 CRPA 抑制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\,\\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以上干扰（与 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons\">精确制导技术</a> 的抗干扰直接关联）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"天基预警与反卫星\">天基预警与反卫星</h3><p>天基红外系统（SBIRS）能在弹道导弹助推段（发射后约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 秒内）探测火箭发动机的强红外辐射，是导弹防御的「第一道防线」（详见 <a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹与防御系统</a>）。SDA「跟踪层」低轨星座补充了对 <a href=\"hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速目标</a> 的跟踪。反卫星（ASAT）手段包括动能反卫星导弹、共轨反卫星卫星、激光致盲和电子干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2024–2026 年核心趋势：太空态势感知（SSA）能力建设加速；低轨大星座军事化趋势明显，美军推进「增殖型低地球轨道」（pLEO）架构提高韧性；太空碎片问题严峻，2021 年俄罗斯反卫星试验产生约 1500 块可追踪碎片；可重复使用运载火箭大幅降低发射成本（SpaceX Falcon 9 每公斤入轨成本约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 1: \\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\</span></span>2700$），使快速补网和应急发射成为可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>商业遥感卫星分辨率已达亚米级，这对传统军事侦察卫星的独占优势意味着什么？商业太空情报如何改变了战争透明度？</li>\n<li>低轨大规模星座（数千颗卫星）如何改变太空攻防态势？用反卫星导弹逐一击落它们是否经济可行？</li>\n<li>太空军事化是否不可避免？国际社会应如何建立太空军控机制来防止太空军备竞赛？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹与防御系统</a>、<a href=\"hypersonic-weapons\">高超声速武器</a>。</li>\n<li>卫星信号的干扰与抗干扰见 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/electronic-warfare\">电子战技术</a>；导航战与制导精度的关系见 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons\">精确制导技术</a>；卫星链路的网络防护见 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/cyber-warfare\">网络战技术</a>。</li>\n<li>本 hub 整体定位见 <a href=\"../\">军事技术学科简介</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>军事卫星系统是现代信息化战争的基础设施，为侦察、通信、导航和预警提供不可替代的太空支撑。四类卫星功能互补，共同构成完整的天基信息体系。随着太空从「战略后方」变为「作战前沿」，反卫星能力和太空防御成为新焦点；低轨大星座以分散化和韧性设计应对日益增长的反太空威胁。把握「四类卫星即四种信息能力」这条主线，再看它如何支撑 <a href=\"ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹防御</a> 与 <a href=\"../information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons\">精确制导</a>，便能理解太空为何是大国必争的制高点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"军事卫星系统","id":"军事卫星系统"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"四类军事卫星对比","id":"四类军事卫星对比"},{"level":3,"text":"侦察卫星：太空的眼睛","id":"侦察卫星-太空的眼睛"},{"level":3,"text":"通信卫星：抗干扰与低延迟","id":"通信卫星-抗干扰与低延迟"},{"level":3,"text":"导航卫星与导航战","id":"导航卫星与导航战"},{"level":3,"text":"天基预警与反卫星","id":"天基预警与反卫星"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"精确制导技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons"},"next":{"title":"弹道导弹与防御系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles"}}